[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14223.91, "timestamp": "03:57:03", "text": "我也很担心自己的身体状况，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14225.59, "timestamp": "03:57:05", "text": "再次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14231.11, "timestamp": "03:57:11", "text": "很遗憾，我和恐怖片不太合拍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14234.55, "timestamp": "03:57:14", "text": "确实会很痛，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14237.75, "timestamp": "03:57:17", "text": "我希望我能活过今天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14239.83, "timestamp": "03:57:19", "text": "等等，这游戏到底要玩多久来着？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14241.91, "timestamp": "03:57:21", "text": "我觉得我一天之内就能完成吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14244.15, "timestamp": "03:57:24", "text": "否则，我将继续把它作为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14247.03, "timestamp": "03:57:27", "text": "我猜是系列作品吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14249.03, "timestamp": "03:57:29", "text": "他对恐怖游戏有一些建议。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14251.59, "timestamp": "03:57:31", "text": "是的，你可以在Discord上给我提建议，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14254.55, "timestamp": "03:57:34", "text": "在直播中，因为消息会是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14256.63, "timestamp": "03:57:36", "text": "已登录，对吧？所以，我只需要看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14258.229, "timestamp": "03:57:38", "text": "它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14260.95, "timestamp": "03:57:40", "text": "嗯，这样可行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14263.59, "timestamp": "03:57:43", "text": "好了，我们现在开始游戏吧。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14266.229, "timestamp": "03:57:46", "text": "让我打开看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14269.83, "timestamp": "03:57:49", "text": "我昨天才打开这个游戏，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14273.59, "timestamp": "03:57:53", "text": "就像我查看过一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14275.75, "timestamp": "03:57:55", "text": "所以，关于设置之类的。好的，"}]